The '''Wanderer's Path''' was a road that ran through the thick vine jungles of the [[planet]] [[Devaron]]. Adolescents would accompany experienced Wanderers on expeditions out into the dense jungles as part of a formal rite of passage established during the planet's history.<ref name="NoP" />

